Here you go:

## Serialization

Instantiate the serializer:
```php
$cacheDir = sprintf('%s/symfony_serializer_bench/template', sys_get_temp_dir());

$typeExtractor = new PhpstanTypeExtractor(new ReflectionTypeExtractor());
$runtimeServicesLocator = new class([]) implements ContainerInterface {
    use ServiceLocatorTrait;
};

return new Serializer(
    new Template(new TemplateVariationExtractor(), ['json' => new JsonTemplateGenerator()], $cacheDir),
    new DataModelBuilder(
        new TypePropertyMetadataLoader(new AttributePropertyMetadataLoader($typeExtractor), $typeExtractor),
        $runtimeServicesLocator,
    ),
    $runtimeServicesLocator,
    $cacheDir,
);
```

Then warm up the cache:
```php
$serializer->serialize($data, 'json', new MemoryStream());
```

Then you can measure:
```php
$serializer->serialize($data, 'json');
```

## Deserialization

Instantiate the deserializer:
```php
$templateCacheDir = sprintf('%s/symfony_serializer_bench/template', sys_get_temp_dir());

$typeExtractor = new PhpstanTypeExtractor(new ReflectionTypeExtractor());
$runtimeServicesLocator = new class([]) implements ContainerInterface {
    use ServiceLocatorTrait;
};
$instantiator = new EagerInstantiator();
// $instantiator = new LazyInstantiator(sprintf('%s/symfony_serializer_bench/lazy_object', sys_get_temp_dir()));

$deserializer = new Deserializer(
    new Template(
        new TemplateVariationExtractor(),
        ['json' => ['eager' => new EagerTemplateGenerator(JsonDecoder::class), 'lazy' => new LazyTemplateGenerator(JsonDecoder::class, JsonSplitter::class)]],
        $templateCacheDir,
        false,
    ),
    new DataModelBuilder(
        new TypePropertyMetadataLoader(new AttributePropertyMetadataLoader($typeExtractor), $typeExtractor),
        $runtimeServicesLocator,
    ),
    $runtimeServicesLocator,
    $instantiator,
    $templateCacheDir,
);
```

Then warm up the cache before running speed tests:
```php
$deserializer->deserialize('', Type::iterableList(Type::class(Element::class)), 'json');
```

Then you can finally measure the deserialization:
```php
$deserializer->deserialize(new Stream($filename, 'rb'), Type::iterableList(Type::class(Element::class)), 'json');
```

